{"id":"rdb-33512b","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"Write a comprehensive user-facing guide at `docs/guide.md` covering the full operational workflow:\n\n- Installation and initial setup (`repodb init`, repo structure)\n- CLI command reference with flags and examples\n- Persistence modes: journal (default) vs native-git, how to switch\n- Server configuration (`repodb start` flags, MySQL client access)\n- Data lifecycle: status, diff, commit (checkpoint)\n- Sync workflow: enable, sync, conflicts, resolve\n- Embedded Go API overview (pointer to `docs/sql-m2.md` for full reference)\n- Journal backup, recovery, and checkpoint procedures\n- Hook policy (what hooks exist, when they fire)\n\nThe existing docs cover individual subsystems (sql-m2, sync-m3, merge-m4, working-state) but there is no unified guide. This doc should be the starting point for new users after the README quickstart.\"","status":"PLANNED","sort_order":"a0","assignee":"Claude Code \u003cagent@macbook.local\u003e","dependencies":null,"labels":null},"created_at":"2026-09-17T10:18:05.013632Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.273 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
