{"id":"rdb-22f505","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-20a426b1-89a5-40f7-83ae-a9f9c900eb6f","text":"Implemented per spec. One refinement: Dolt answers `VERSION()` with the MySQL version it emulates (8.0.31), so the harness also queries `dolt_version()` and records `Dolt 2.3.5 (VERSION() 8.0.31)`. MySQL records `8.4.11`. The smoke run against Dolt lists the lost-update failure under \"Correctness failures:\". `make lint` and `make test` pass."},"created_at":"2026-09-28T11:19:07.563894Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.283 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
