{"id":"rdb-cf3eab","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Refresh latest.md scorecard at c1aa399 (key format v2, row format v3, lazy replay)","description":"latest.md was measured at `57a0cd8`. Since then, rdb-92b9e2 (journal replay loads only what it needs), rdb-586f81 (order-preserving keys with range and ORDER BY/LIMIT pushdown) and rdb-ee17d5 (binary row encoding) changed read, scan and sync performance. Re-measure all four modes at one clean commit (`c1aa399`), archive the current latest.md to history, publish the new one, and refresh the README table, following benchmark.md § Publishing results.","status":"PLANNED","estimate":2,"sort_order":"a7","dependencies":[{"source_id":"rdb-cf3eab","target_id":"rdb-6ae82d","kind":"relates_to"},{"source_id":"rdb-cf3eab","target_id":"rdb-ee17d5","kind":"relates_to"},{"source_id":"rdb-cf3eab","target_id":"rdb-59c7d7","kind":"relates_to"}],"labels":["task","docs"]},"created_at":"2026-09-28T15:52:57.757275Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.283 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
