{"id":"rdb-515fae","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-2d3f43e8-88b3-4b45-8bd7-949f8a6a6099","text":"Reopened to BACKLOG: xpo auto-completed this parent when its child rdb-4d677f merged (`db2bdbd`), and auto-started it earlier when the child started. The child delivered only the minimal slice (compaction at checkpoint). The configurable retention policy, archiving and `repodb compact` remain open here."},"created_at":"2026-10-01T19:10:35.683739Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.286 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
