{"id":"rdb-13fbd8","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Refresh latest.md scorecard at f944eee (content-local Prolly, format v4, journal default)","description":"latest.md was measured at `c1aa399`. Since then:\n- **rdb-fb3d12:** content-local Prolly chunk boundaries (format v4). Native-git writes are 2–3× faster, checkpoints are flat across batch sizes, and the dbbench update stalls are gone.\n- **rdb-2124bc:** dbbench fixtures disable Git auto-maintenance and run `git gc` untimed (`\"git_gc\": \"manual\"`).\n- **rdb-4d677f:** journal compaction at checkpoint.\n- **rdb-e0c717:** publication guard (native-git commits take `working.lock`).\n- **rdb-c56142:** journal is the default for the CLI and server. The README and summary should present journal as the default and native-git as audit mode.\n\nRe-measure all four modes at one clean commit (`f944eee`) and replace latest.md and `docs/benchmarks/latest/*.json` in place, following benchmark.md § Publishing results. Then update the README table. Compare with `c1aa399`, using MySQL and Dolt as the noise reference.\n\nThis closes rdb-c56142's last acceptance item: \"the next scorecard's README table and summary reflect the default\".","status":"PLANNED","sort_order":"a8","dependencies":[{"source_id":"rdb-13fbd8","target_id":"rdb-cf3eab","kind":"relates_to"},{"source_id":"rdb-13fbd8","target_id":"rdb-fb3d12","kind":"relates_to"},{"source_id":"rdb-13fbd8","target_id":"rdb-c56142","kind":"relates_to"},{"source_id":"rdb-13fbd8","target_id":"rdb-2124bc","kind":"relates_to"},{"source_id":"rdb-13fbd8","target_id":"rdb-4d677f","kind":"relates_to"}],"labels":["task","docs"]},"created_at":"2026-10-01T20:51:00.919846Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.286 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
