{"id":"rdb-13fbd8","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-f523a152-9b13-461c-8d49-e9f2126b8b3f","text":"BLOCKED on rdb-162912 (user decision: fix first, then re-run). The run at `f944eee` completed cleanly for all four modes. The render script was validated against the `c1aa399` tables, and the `f944eee` JSONs are kept in the scratchpad. The run showed a native-git contended-increment regression, bisected to rdb-e0c717. After rdb-162912 merges, all four modes are re-run at the new main commit and that run is published."},"created_at":"2026-10-02T05:22:54.713934Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.286 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
