{"id":"rdb-2945ff","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Publish scorecard at 6b76e87 as latest.md (performance round: format 6)","description":"Publish a new scorecard after the 2026-10-02 performance round, following `docs/benchmark.md` § Publishing results.\n\nThe round, since `636af3d`:\n- rdb-48f066: binary Prolly nodes, projection pushdown, row counts (format 5);\n- rdb-a6a4d2: shared journal overlay;\n- rdb-24820a: shared index overlay;\n- rdb-acd36d: reverse index scans;\n- rdb-a0d510: mixed boundary hash and 64/256 chunks (format 6);\n- rdb-6bd369: `PendingRows.With` sort.\n\nSteps:\n- [ ] Run native-git, journal, MySQL and Dolt with `make bench-docker` at the clean commit `6b76e87`, sequentially, one baseline container at a time. The baseline images must match latest.md's digests (MySQL `0744ee5e…`, Dolt `36fdd43d…`).\n- [ ] Replace `docs/benchmarks/latest.md` and `docs/benchmarks/latest/*.json`.\n- [ ] Add \"Changes since `636af3d`\", using the MySQL and Dolt reruns as the noise reference.\n- [ ] Update the README performance table.","status":"PLANNED","sort_order":"a8","dependencies":[{"source_id":"rdb-2945ff","target_id":"rdb-48f066","kind":"relates_to"},{"source_id":"rdb-2945ff","target_id":"rdb-a6a4d2","kind":"relates_to"},{"source_id":"rdb-2945ff","target_id":"rdb-24820a","kind":"relates_to"},{"source_id":"rdb-2945ff","target_id":"rdb-acd36d","kind":"relates_to"},{"source_id":"rdb-2945ff","target_id":"rdb-a0d510","kind":"relates_to"},{"source_id":"rdb-2945ff","target_id":"rdb-6bd369","kind":"relates_to"}],"labels":["task","docs"]},"created_at":"2026-10-02T09:56:27.436871Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.286 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
